# Claims

- State only what a test or log from this run proves.
- Name the command, the exit code, and the SHA.
- Record skipped tests. An exit of 0 does not prove a skipped case.
- A green offline test does not prove a live lab host, a publish, or a deploy.
- When a command was not run, say it was not run.
